00:00:34.247 --> 00:00:36.081
TIME SHE WAS ARRESTED A FEW

00:00:36.082 --> 00:00:37.215
MONTHS BEFORE THAT.

00:00:37.216 --> 00:00:39.151
AND SO TO THE EXTENT -- I KNOW

00:00:39.152 --> 00:00:40.252
THE STORY SOUNDS CRAZY.

00:00:40.253 --> 00:00:43.121
BUT TO THE EXTENT IT INTERSECTS

00:00:43.122 --> 00:00:44.856
