00:00:46.626 --> 00:00:48.860
AS TO WHAT THE CONTACTS ARE FOR

00:00:48.861 --> 00:00:50.462
THE GOVERNMENT, MY MAIN CONCERN

00:00:50.463 --> 00:00:52.097
AS HER DEFENSE LAWYER IS HE'S

00:00:52.098 --> 00:00:54.499
TOLD ME THAT HE GAVE THE

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.401
GOVERNMENT EXCULPATORY

00:00:56.402 --> 00:00:57.602
INFORMATION SAYING HE'S

00:00:57.603 --> 00:00:59.237
CONCERNED ABOUT HER, CONCLUDED

00:00:59.238 --> 00:01:01.239
SHE WASN'T A SPY, CONCLUDED SHE

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.941
WAS AN HONEST PERSON TRYING TO

00:01:02.942 --> 00:01:04.543
DO WHAT SHE WAS TRYING TO DO AS

00:01:04.544 --> 00:01:06.778
A STUDENT AND CONVEYED IT TO THE

00:01:06.779 --> 00:01:07.045
FBI.

00:01:07.046 --> 00:01:09.281
AND IF IT'S A 302, IT SHOULD

00:01:09.282 --> 00:01:11.483
HAVE BEEN TURNED OVER

00:01:11.484 --> 00:01:13.084
&gt;&gt; Laura: THIS IS THE BRADY RULE

00:01:13.085 --> 00:01:15.187
FOR THE LAW GEEKS OUT THERE,

00:01:15.188 --> 00:01:15.520
WANNABE.

00:01:15.521 --> 00:01:17.456
SO THE BRADY RULE REQUIRES THE

00:01:17.457 --> 00:01:18.757
