00:01:18.758 --> 00:01:20.392
DEFENDANT'S TEAM ALL EX-

00:01:20.393 --> 00:01:21.460
DEFENDANT'S TEAM ALL ECULPATORY

00:01:21.461 --> 00:01:22.260
INFORMATION.

00:01:22.261 --> 00:01:24.296
NOW, BYRNE IS SAYING THAT

00:01:24.297 --> 00:01:29.201
PETER STRAUCK WAS IN THE MIDDLE

00:01:29.202 --> 00:01:29.701
OF THIS.

00:01:29.702 --> 00:01:32.003
THIS WENT TO THE HIGHEST LEVELS,

00:01:32.004 --> 00:01:33.238
COMEY, McCABE, ON DOWN.

00:01:33.239 --> 00:01:34.105
THIS IS WILD.

00:01:34.106 --> 00:01:35.740
I HAVE A FULL DECLARATION OF

00:01:35.741 --> 00:01:36.875
WHAT I KNOW.

00:01:36.876 --> 00:01:38.677
I'VE KNOWN PATRICK BYRNE SINCE

00:01:38.678 --> 00:01:40.145
OUR FIRST WEEK IN COLLEGE.

00:01:40.146 --> 00:01:42.747
WE WERE BOTH THE SAME CLASS IN

00:01:42.748 --> 00:01:43.081
COLLEGE.

