00:02:16.582 --> 00:02:18.617
RIGHT NOW TO LOOK IF THERE WAS

00:02:18.618 --> 00:02:20.919
ANY BRADY MATERIAL WITHHELD OR

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.721
ANY MISCONDUCT WITH RESPECT TO

00:02:22.722 --> 00:02:23.722
