00:02:23.723 --> 00:02:25.657
&gt;&gt; DOES THIS SURPRISE YOU?

00:02:25.658 --> 00:02:27.659
I KNOW YOU'VE KNOWN ABOUT HER

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.060
RELATIONSHIP WITH BYRNE FOR

00:02:29.061 --> 00:02:29.427
