00:02:33.165 --> 00:02:34.299
HILLARY'S NAME MENTIONED BY

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.201
BYRNE SAYING SOMEONE MIGHT HAVE

00:02:36.202 --> 00:02:38.036
BEEN TRYING TO BLACKMAIL HER AT

00:02:38.037 --> 00:02:38.770
SOME POINT.

00:02:38.771 --> 00:02:39.871
DOES THAT SURPRISE YOU?

00:02:39.872 --> 00:02:42.340
&gt;&gt; IT'S WILD.

00:02:42.341 --> 00:02:44.309
WHEN I SPOKE WITH PATRICK.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:46.244
IT'S REALLY -- I GOT THE SAME

00:02:46.245 --> 00:02:48.179
REACTION THREE WEEKS AGO,

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.781
EVERYBODY WATCHING CABLE LAST

00:02:49.782 --> 00:02:51.049
NIGHT THINKING TO MYSELF, THIS

