SO I HAVE TO TAKE IT SERIOUSLY.

00:03:03.262 --> 00:03:04.663
AT LEAST THE GOVERNMENT SHOULD

00:03:04.664 --> 00:03:06.631
TAKE IT SERIOUSLY.

