BECAUSE WHAT INTERSECTS WITH

00:03:08.501 --> 00:03:10.068
WHAT I KNOW AND WHAT I CAN PROVE

00:03:10.069 --> 00:03:11.236
IS GENERALLY ACCURATE.

00:03:11.237 --> 00:03:13.371
&gt;&gt; WHY DID THEY BREAK UP?

00:03:13.372 --> 00:03:15.307
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK IT WAS A CLOSE

