00:03:26.052 --> 00:03:28.453
THERE WERE HOTEL ROOMS INVOLVED,

00:03:28.454 --> 00:03:30.055
TWO ROOM, ONE ROOM, UNCLEAR

00:03:30.056 --> 00:03:32.023
THERE?

00:03:32.024 --> 00:03:34.492
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE, YOU ARE, BUT,

