MOST -- SHE WAS DATING SOMEONE

00:03:36.829 --> 00:03:37.128
ELSE.

00:03:37.129 --> 00:03:39.864
THERE'S COMPLICATING FACTORS.

00:03:39.865 --> 00:03:43.535
I'M NOT DR. PHIL ON THAT FRONT.

00:03:43.536 --> 00:03:44.903
&gt;&gt; Laura: HOW CREDIBLE IS THIS

00:03:44.904 --> 00:03:46.404
CLAIM, THOUGH, THAT WITH ALL OF

00:03:46.405 --> 00:03:48.106
YOUR EXPERIENCE WITH THE FBI

00:03:48.107 --> 00:03:49.641
SPECIFICALLY COMEY WAS THE

