DIRECTOR AT THE TIME DIRECTED

00:03:52.845 --> 00:03:55.647
HIM TO HAVE AN ONGOING

00:03:55.648 --> 00:03:57.482
RELATIONSHIP WITH SOMEONE THEY

00:03:57.483 --> 00:03:58.583
BELIEVED WAS A RUSSIAN

00:03:58.584 --> 00:04:03.388
OPERATIVE.

00:04:03.389 --> 00:04:05.590
&gt;&gt; WHEN A GAL COMES TO YOU FROM

00:04:05.591 --> 00:04:07.125
RUSSIA AND SAYS I'VE BEEN SENT

00:04:07.126 --> 00:04:09.561
HERE TO MAKE CONTACT AND WE WANT

00:04:09.562 --> 00:04:11.463
