00:04:15.067 --> 00:04:16.534
SO NOW THE MEN IN BLACK WERE

00:04:16.535 --> 00:04:17.535
BACK IN MY LIFE.

00:04:17.536 --> 00:04:18.803
AND I WAS TRYING TO ENCOURAGE

00:04:18.804 --> 00:04:20.605
HER TO HAVE A RELATIONSHIP.

00:04:20.606 --> 00:04:22.207
LAST TIME I WAS WATCHING

00:04:22.208 --> 00:04:23.408
TELEVISION AND CONGRESSIONAL

00:04:23.409 --> 00:04:25.944
HEARINGS, I FIGURED WHERE THE

00:04:25.945 --> 00:04:27.078
ORDERS CAME FROM, THEY CAME FROM

00:04:27.079 --> 00:04:32.784
A GUY NAMED PERIOD STRAUK.

00:04:32.785 --> 00:04:34.452
CARLIN, McCABE, COMEY.

00:04:34.453 --> 00:04:36.755
THAT'S WHO SENT THE ORDERS.

00:04:36.756 --> 00:04:37.722
&gt;&gt; Laura: PEOPLE ARE WATCHING

00:04:37.723 --> 00:04:39.124
THIS GOING, WHAT?

00:04:39.125 --> 00:04:41.526
SO PATRICK BYRNE HAD A LOW-LEVEL

00:04:41.527 --> 00:04:42.060
SECURITY CLEARANCE.

00:04:42.061 --> 00:04:43.461
HE WANTED TO KEEP IT.

00:04:43.462 --> 00:04:44.863
THAT'S WHY HE REPORTED TO

00:04:44.864 --> 00:04:46.665
WHATEVER PERSON AT THE FBI HE

00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:49.100
REPORTED TO ABOUT HIS

00:04:49.101 --> 00:04:51.202
RELATIONSHIP OR THE CONNECTION

00:04:51.203 --> 00:04:53.471
WITH MARTINA.

00:04:53.472 --> 00:04:59.044
BUT COMEY, McCABE, INVOLVEMENT

00:04:59.045 --> 00:05:02.180
WITH STRAUCK.

00:05:02.181 --> 00:05:03.548
THEY'RE REJECTING THE NOTION

00:05:03.549 --> 00:05:04.783
SAYING IT'S RIDICULOUS.

