THE FBI DOESN'T WORK THAT WAY.

00:05:06.318 --> 00:05:07.185
WHAT'S THE TRUTH HERE?

00:05:07.186 --> 00:05:09.387
DOES THE FBI EVER WORK THAT WAY?

00:05:09.388 --> 00:05:11.923
&gt;&gt; SURE, IN A

00:05:11.924 --> 00:05:12.924
