00:05:27.807 --> 00:05:30.008
HER AND ASK HER TO REKINDLE

00:05:30.009 --> 00:05:31.009
WHATEVER RELATIONSHIP THEY HAD,

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.044
IF THEY WERE INTERESTED IN HER,

00:05:33.045 --> 00:05:34.245
WHICH WE KNEW THEY WERE.

00:05:34.246 --> 00:05:35.547
AND THERE WERE OTHER THINGS

00:05:35.548 --> 00:05:37.649
GOING ON IN 2015 AND 2016.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:40.285
SO THEY COULD HAVE ALSO

00:05:40.286 --> 00:05:41.386
BENEFITTED FROM THE IDEA THAT IF

00:05:41.387 --> 00:05:44.022
YOU HAVE, FOR EXAMPLE, TAKE

00:05:44.023 --> 00:05:45.457
HYPOTHETICALLY THE RUSSIAN TRUMP

00:05:45.458 --> 00:05:46.825
INVESTIGATION, IF THAT WAS IN

00:05:46.826 --> 00:05:48.993
ITS EARLY STAGES AND WAS A

00:05:48.994 --> 00:05:50.361
PRELIMINARY INQUIRY, THEN YOU

00:05:50.362 --> 00:05:51.563
CAN ACTUALLY REACH OUT TO A

00:05:51.564 --> 00:05:53.865
CURRENT OR FORMER ASSET LIKE

00:05:53.866 --> 00:05:55.366
THAT WHEREAS YOU WOULD HAVE TO

00:05:55.367 --> 00:05:57.168
GET SPECIAL APPROVAL IN THE

00:05:57.169 --> 00:05:58.770
PRELIMINARY INQUIRY TO REACH OUT

00:05:58.771 --> 00:06:00.305
AND DEVELOP A NEW ASSET.

00:06:00.306 --> 00:06:02.207
SO, THEY HAD A LOT OF REASONS

00:06:02.208 --> 00:06:03.708
THEY MIGHT HAVE WANTED TO USE

00:06:03.709 --> 00:06:04.008
THEM.

00:06:04.009 --> 00:06:06.811
AS FAR AS THE PART ABOUT

00:06:06.812 --> 00:06:08.146
DIRECTOR COMEY SPECIFICALLY SAID

00:06:08.147 --> 00:06:10.448
SOMETHING TO ME OR DEPUTY

00:06:10.449 --> 00:06:11.683
DIRECTOR McCABE, SOMETHING LIKE

00:06:11.684 --> 00:06:13.284
THAT, THAT MAY NOT BE EXACTLY

00:06:13.285 --> 00:06:15.053
WHAT HE MEANT TO CONVEY.

00:06:15.054 --> 00:06:16.788
I WOULD THINK THAT -- AND I

00:06:16.789 --> 00:06:17.622
WATCHED THIS INTERVIEW ON

00:06:17.623 --> 00:06:21.860
TELEVISION.

00:06:21.861 --> 00:06:23.962
I THINK HE MEANT TO CONVEY THE

00:06:23.963 --> 00:06:25.530
AGENTS THAT WERE TALKING TO HIM

00:06:25.531 --> 00:06:26.831
HAD LET HIM KNOW THAT THESE WERE

00:06:26.832 --> 00:06:28.533
THE PEOPLE CALLING THE SHOTS.

00:06:28.534 --> 00:06:29.801
IT'S ALL VERY INTERESTING.

00:06:29.802 --> 00:06:31.236
IT'S ALL KIND OF -- IF YOU

00:06:31.237 --> 00:06:32.570
WATCHED IT, IT'S THE --

00:06:32.571 --> 00:06:34.806
&gt;&gt; IT'S ANOTHER CHARACTER IN

00:06:34.807 --> 00:06:37.242
THIS ONGOING DRAMA.

00:06:37.243 --> 00:06:40.845
AND HARMEED AND I BOTH WENT TO

00:06:40.846 --> 00:06:42.814
THE SAME COLLEGE.

00:06:42.815 --> 00:06:44.349
PATRICK BYRNE, I WAS LIKE WHAT

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:44.949
IS THIS?

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.217
THIS IS BIZARRE.

00:06:46.218 --> 00:06:48.887
BUT IT DOESN'T SEEM TO ME TO BE

00:06:48.888 --> 00:06:52.423
OUT OF THE REALM OF POSSIBILITY

00:06:52.424 --> 00:06:54.692
THAT STRAUCK AND COMEY, ANYTHING

00:06:54.693 --> 00:06:56.060
THEY CAN DO AT THIS POINT TO

00:06:56.061 --> 00:06:57.529
