00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.664
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY, LAURA, OUT OF

00:06:59.665 --> 00:07:01.266
THESE PEOPLE, SOME OF THEM ARE

00:07:01.267 --> 00:07:03.001
