MANY OF US BELIEVE COMEY

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:06.604
CERTAINLY LIED REPEATEDLY.

00:07:06.605 --> 00:07:07.505
THAT'S BEEN FOUND.

00:07:07.506 --> 00:07:11.009
AND McCABE AND STRAUCK WERE

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.644
FIRED FOR LYING.

00:07:12.645 --> 00:07:14.546
ALTHOUGH THESE CHARACTERS, THIS

00:07:14.547 --> 00:07:15.847
TALE IS A WILD ONE, I HAVE TO

00:07:15.848 --> 00:07:18.149
SAY I'M GOING TO SUSPEND

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.051
JUDGMENT ON THAT AS WE HEAR MORE

00:07:20.052 --> 00:07:20.351
FACTS.

00:07:20.352 --> 00:07:22.987
BUT ROBERT SAID THIS IS LINING

00:07:22.988 --> 00:07:24.889
UP FROM THE POINT OF VIEW OF HIS

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:26.791
CLIENT, THE BRADY VIOLATIONS ARE

00:07:26.792 --> 00:07:29.294
OF A PIECE OF WHAT WE HEARD OUT

00:07:29.295 --> 00:07:31.095
