00:07:31.096 --> 00:07:32.931
FAILURE BY THE DOJ OFFICIALS TO

00:07:32.932 --> 00:07:35.166
TURN OVER THE INFORMATION THAT'S

00:07:35.167 --> 00:07:35.567
EXCULPATORY.

00:07:35.568 --> 00:07:37.702
SO I'M PREPARED TO BELIEVE A LOT

00:07:37.703 --> 00:07:38.236
OF THIS.

00:07:38.237 --> 00:07:40.104
SOME OF THE DETAILS ARE HAZY.

00:07:40.105 --> 00:07:43.508
A NUMBER OF DIFFERENT INTERVIEWS

00:07:43.509 --> 00:07:44.609
FROM SLIGHTLY DIFFERENT FACTS.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.377
&gt;&gt; I HAVE A QUESTION HERE.

00:07:46.378 --> 00:07:49.681
IT'S A BIT OF AN ODD TIMELINE,

00:07:49.682 --> 00:07:53.852
BECAUSE IF STRAUCK AND ALL THESE

00:07:53.853 --> 00:07:55.587
GUYS, COMEY, THEY DIDN'T WANT

00:07:55.588 --> 00:07:57.689
TRUMP TO WIN, AND THEN WHY --

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.024
WE'RE HEARING THIS STUFF ABOUT,

00:08:00.025 --> 00:08:03.294
WELL, IT WAS AN ATTEMPT TO

00:08:03.295 --> 00:08:04.195
BLACKMAIL HILLARY.

00:08:04.196 --> 00:08:05.597
ROBERT, DO YOU UNDERSTAND THAT?

00:08:05.598 --> 00:08:06.898
DO YOU GET THAT ASPECT?

00:08:06.899 --> 00:08:09.033
&gt;&gt; I DO UNDERSTAND THAT ASPECT,

00:08:09.034 --> 00:08:12.070
LAURA, HOWEVER, AGAIN, THIS IS

00:08:12.071 --> 00:08:13.438
COUNTERINTELLIGENCE

00:08:13.439 --> 00:08:14.639
INVESTIGATION, THERE AREN'T ANY

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.941
302s, FOR EXAMPLE,

00:08:16.942 --> 00:08:17.909
COUNTERINTELLIGENCE ASSETS ARE

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:20.245
NOT REPORTED ON 302s, THEY'RE

00:08:20.246 --> 00:08:22.447
REPORTED ON MEMOS AND WHAT WE

00:08:22.448 --> 00:08:23.314
USED TO CALL INSERTS.

00:08:23.315 --> 00:08:24.682
SO THEY'RE NOT THE SAME KIND

